# Raw readouts are NOT committed, following the M7/M8/Q1/UQ-A convention: no raw
# measurement data is versioned, and every verifier recomputes from frozen seeds.
#
# What IS committed is sufficient to reproduce and validate them exactly:
#   candidates.jsonl             every one of the 4000 candidates with its disposition
#   INTEGRITY.sha256             digests + the regeneration command
#   ../results/uqb_results.json  the frozen-protocol outcome, with a per-arm
#                                fingerprint for every configuration
#
# Regenerate with:  cd experiments/uqb && UQB_COLLECTION_AUTHORISED=1 node run_collection.js
# Preflight with :  cd experiments/uqb && node preflight.js
readouts.jsonl
